Object.assign(window.BODY=window.BODY||{},{"q130": "<h3 id=\"例130-丙子日-朱雀带着鬼压上门-防弹劾-六亲-天将-课体\">【例130】丙子日 · 朱雀带着鬼压上门(防弹劾) <code>六亲</code> <code>天将</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：雀鬼格 · 丙子日(返吟)，朱雀作日鬼加干、防弹章</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丙子日</strong>来占词讼/官非。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　兄弟　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　官鬼　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　兄弟　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>午 → 子 → 午</strong>(返吟)，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>丙</strong>；干上 <strong>亥</strong>(乘朱雀)。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　词讼看官鬼、朱雀</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：词讼看&quot;<strong>官鬼</strong>&quot;(官司/对头)和&quot;<strong>朱雀</strong>&quot;(五行属火，主口舌、文书、状纸)。先看这两样凶不凶。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘要看朱雀落在哪、乘的是什么。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　朱雀又作日鬼、压到身上</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：朱雀本主文书口舌，若它同时又是克你的&quot;鬼&quot;、还加到你身上，就成了祸。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：丙是<strong>火</strong>，克火的<strong>水</strong>是鬼。干上坐着亥水(鬼)，而这亥又乘<strong>朱雀(火)</strong>——<strong>朱雀带着日鬼、加在你身上</strong>，叫&quot;雀鬼&quot;。口舌文书之神，偏成了克你的鬼。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：雀鬼加干＝文书口舌招祸。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：主口舌文书惹祸——在朝为官防被弹劾(弹章)，平常防因文书、言语招官非；不宜上书献策，反受责罚。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：防人弹劾、文书招祸</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 词讼看官鬼、朱雀(口舌文书)　② 朱雀作日鬼加干＝雀鬼　③ 口舌文书之神反成克身之鬼　④ 防弹劾、防因文书言语招官非</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·雀鬼格</p>\n<hr>", "q131": "<h3 id=\"例131-丙辰日-三传一路克到我身上-有人害我-旬空-主客-递生递克\">【例131】丙辰日 · 三传一路克到我身上(有人害我) <code>旬空</code> <code>主客</code> <code>递生递克</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：递克格 · 丙辰日第八局(寅加酉)，初寅克中未、未克末子、末子克日干丙(有人害我·末传子空)</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丙辰日</strong>来占官非/被人构陷。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　父母　玄武</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">己　子孙　勾陈</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">官鬼　天后　空亡</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>寅 → 未 → 子</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>丙</strong>(火)；干上 戌、支上 酉。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先看三传彼此的关系</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：词讼被人整，先看三传是彼此相生(和顺)、还是彼此相克(相攻)。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘顺着初→中→末，一步步看谁克谁。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　三传像多米诺、一路克到我</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：看初传克不克中传、中传克不克末传、末传克不克日干——若一环扣一环克下来，就是&quot;递克&quot;。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：初传<strong>寅(木)</strong>克中传<strong>未(土)</strong>，中传<strong>未(土)</strong>克末传<strong>子(水)</strong>，末传<strong>子(水)</strong>再克日干<strong>丙(火)</strong>。<strong>一路递克、最后落到我身上</strong>，叫&quot;递克格&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：递克到干＝有人害我。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：主有人害我，或众口一词、共相欺凌；为官者占得，尤防台阁弹劾，宜自省约束、提防构陷。（末传子恰逢<strong>旬空</strong>，克我的最后一击落点稍虚——害意虽足、其势可解；此格与&quot;递生格·得人举荐&quot;正相反。）</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：有人害我、众人相欺(防弹劾)</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 词讼被整先看三传相生还是相克　② 初克中、中克末、末克干＝递克格　③ 递克到身＝有人害我、共相欺凌　④ 为官防弹劾；与&quot;递生·得人举荐&quot;正相反</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·递克格</p>\n<hr>", "q132": "<h3 id=\"例132-壬申日-墓和华盖一起把我盖住-蒙冤难辩-墓神\">【例132】壬申日 · 墓和华盖一起把我盖住(蒙冤难辩) <code>墓神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：墓作华盖格 · 壬申日第八局，辰为壬水墓神兼华盖、临干上发用(墓覆日·枉遭冤屈)</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>壬申日</strong>来占官司/是非。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　官鬼　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　父母　勾陈</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　子孙　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>辰 → 酉 → 寅</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>壬</strong>(水)；干上 <strong>辰</strong>(发用)＝壬之墓、又是华盖。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　词讼先看自己清不清明</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：打官司先看日干(自己)是清明在外、还是被什么&quot;盖&quot;住、说不清。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：看干上坐的那个字，对日干壬来说是好是坏。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　墓、华盖一齐盖在头上</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：&quot;<strong>墓</strong>&quot;主困、暗、收藏(壬水的墓在辰)；&quot;<strong>华盖</strong>&quot;主遮蔽掩盖(申子辰的华盖也在辰)。两样都落在辰上。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：干上正是<strong>辰</strong>、还发用——辰对壬来说<strong>既是墓、又是华盖</strong>，墓神加华盖一起盖住日干，等于自己被捂得严严实实、昏晦不明。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：墓作华盖覆日＝蒙冤难辩。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：主占身昏晦、遭冤枉而难以分辩——有理说不清、有冤诉不明，打官司主蒙屈难伸。(此格占行人，则主在外处境不如意、不归。)</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：蒙冤难辩、蒙屈难伸</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 词讼先看自己清不清明(日干)　② 辰＝壬墓＋华盖、一齐盖在干上发用　③ 墓作华盖覆日＝昏晦不明　④ 遭冤枉难分辩、打官司蒙屈难伸</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·墓作华盖格</p>\n<hr>", "q133": "<h3 id=\"例133-甲申日-贵人自身难保-还跟用神犯害-官司难赢-旬空-天将-刑冲破害-墓神-类神-课体\">【例133】甲申日 · 贵人自身难保、还跟用神犯害(官司难赢) <code>旬空</code> <code>天将</code> <code>刑冲破害</code> <code>墓神</code> <code>类神</code> <code>课体</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：贵害相加格 · 甲申日第二局夜占(知一课)，夜贵未临支为甲墓又落空、昼贵丑受寅克乘天空、初传子与未相害(据原文&quot;未加申&quot;起盘复现)</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>甲申日</strong>夜里来占官司输赢。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　父母　白虎</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　父母　太常</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　妻财　玄武</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>子 → 亥 → 戌</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>甲</strong>(木)；干上 丑、支上 <strong>未</strong>(夜贵)。旬空 <strong>午未</strong>。</p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原书只给了<strong>初传子</strong>（<q class=\"yw\">初传子与未又为害</q>），中末传没给。四课两处下贼上（丑、子），比用取与日干同阳的子 → <strong>知一课</strong>，中末递取得亥、戌。原数据的<q class=\"yw\">未寅</q>按此盘排不出来，已改为<strong>子亥戌</strong>（正文只用到初传子害未，不受影响）。</p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　打官司先看贵人给不给力</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：词讼靠&quot;贵人&quot;——盘上的贵人象征主审、说情、援手的力量。先找昼夜两个贵人各落在哪、状态好不好。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘夜占：夜贵是<strong>未</strong>(正在支上)、昼贵是丑(在干上)，一个个查。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　两个贵人个个带伤</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：贵人要帮你，自己得先站得稳。贵人入墓＝昏聩无力；落空亡＝指望落空；被克、乘天空＝受制又虚诈。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：夜贵<strong>未</strong>恰是甲木的<strong>墓</strong>(木墓在未)、又落<strong>旬空</strong>(午未空)——贵人陷在墓里还落了空；昼贵<strong>丑</strong>(土)临寅地被<strong>寅木克</strong>、上乘<strong>天空</strong>(土将、主虚诈)——受制又不实。两贵没一个帮得上。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　&quot;贵&quot;和&quot;害&quot;还缠在一起</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：更糟的是六害：子未相害。贵人与用神相害＝好意变坏事、越帮越乱。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：初传<strong>子</strong>与夜贵<strong>未</strong>正犯<strong>子未相害</strong>，子上还乘<strong>白虎</strong>(金、主凶讼刑伤)——贵与害相加，官司里的&quot;援手&quot;反成添乱的人。断：占讼<strong>理虽直、必遭曲断</strong>，小事能拖成大凶；只宜识时务、屈就求和，别硬打。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：理直曲断、宜和莫讼</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 词讼先查昼夜贵人的状态　② 夜贵未＝甲墓＋落空、昼贵丑受克＋乘天空＝两贵皆伤　③ 初传子害未＝贵害相加、越帮越乱　④ 理直也遭曲断、宜屈就求和</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·贵害相加格</p>\n<hr>", "q134": "<h3 id=\"例134-己亥日-对头虚张声势-其实咬不动我-虽斗无祸-旬空-六亲\">【例134】己亥日 · 对头虚张声势、其实咬不动我(虽斗无祸) <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：抱鸡不斗格 · 己亥日第三局，初传卯克己土日干却坐旬空巳地(无意克干·虽斗无祸)</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>己亥日</strong>来占官司/口角——对方来势汹汹，怕不怕？</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　官鬼　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　兄弟　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">己　妻财　天后</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>卯 → 丑 → 亥</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>己</strong>(土)；发用 <strong>卯</strong>＝官鬼，坐 <strong>巳</strong> 地(旬空辰巳)。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　词讼看克我的&quot;鬼&quot;有没有力</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：打官司先看盘上克日干的&quot;<strong>官鬼</strong>&quot;——那是找我麻烦、跟我对簿公堂的对头。关键看它有力没力。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘发用卯(木)克己土＝<strong>官鬼</strong>当头，看它落在什么地方。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　鬼落了空、光叫唤不真咬</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：鬼再凶，只要它坐上<strong>旬空</strong>、就成了没底气的空架子。再看有没有别的传来给它助力。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：初传卯落在<strong>巳</strong>地、而巳正是本旬旬空——<strong>鬼落了空</strong>。末传亥虽来生卯(亥水生卯木)、想给它撑腰，可卯自己踩着空、终究使不上劲。像抱着的斗鸡摆架子却不真斗。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：抱鸡不斗＝虽斗无祸。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：虽有争斗口角、对头看着凶，但鬼虚落空、克不动我——虚张声势、争而无祸，官司不必怕。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：虽有争斗、终不成祸（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 词讼看克我的官鬼有没有力　② 鬼卯落旬空＝没底气的空架子　③ 末传虽助、鬼虚仍克不动我＝抱鸡不斗　④ 虚张声势、争而无祸</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·抱鸡不斗格</p>\n<hr>", "q135": "<h3 id=\"例135-庚午日-为点钱-把咬我的鬼喂大了-因财致祸-六亲-天将-类神\">【例135】庚午日 · 为点钱、把咬我的鬼喂大了(因财致祸) <code>六亲</code> <code>天将</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：末助初鬼格 · 庚午日第三局，干上午为庚鬼、末传寅财生初传午鬼来克日干(因财致祸·被人诬告)</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>庚午日</strong>来占是非官非——是不是因钱财牵出来的。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">庚　官鬼　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">戊　父母　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　妻财　螣蛇</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>午 → 辰 → 寅</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>庚</strong>(金)；干上 <strong>午</strong>(庚之官鬼)。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　看克我的鬼、背后有没有人撑腰</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：词讼看官鬼(对头/官非)，更要看这鬼是孤身来的、还是有别的传在背后给它助力。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘干上午(火)克庚金＝<strong>官鬼</strong>当头，再往末传看它的来路。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　末传的&quot;财&quot;反把克我的&quot;鬼&quot;喂旺</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：末传<strong>寅</strong>(木)是庚金的<strong>财</strong>(庚克寅木＝财)。看这财往哪走。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这末传寅财不去生我、反去生初传<strong>午</strong>火(木生火)、把鬼喂得更旺，午鬼再回头克庚。<strong>为了点财、反把咬我的鬼养大了</strong>，叫&quot;末助初鬼&quot;。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：末助初鬼＝因财致祸。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：主因财惹祸、或被人诬告兴讼——末传寅木即那个教唆词讼之人(公吏、道士、有须或属虎、木旁姓氏之人，凭天将类神再细推)。尤不宜贪财取财，否则反招官非。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：因财致祸、被人诬告</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 词讼看官鬼、也看谁在背后助它　② 末传财生初传鬼、鬼再克我＝末助初鬼　③ 为点财把克我的鬼喂旺＝因财致祸　④ 防被人诬告兴讼、不宜贪财取财</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·末助初鬼格</p>\n<hr>", "q136": "<h3 id=\"例136-庚戌日-想教唆害我-帮凶却落了空-教唆败露-旬空-六亲\">【例136】庚戌日 · 想教唆害我、帮凶却落了空(教唆败露) <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：枉做恶人格 · 庚戌日第三局，末传寅旬空、扶不起初传午鬼来克庚(教唆者白当恶人·必自败露)</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>庚戌日</strong>来占官非——是不是有人在背后教唆整我。</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　官鬼　青龙</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　父母　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　螣蛇　空亡</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>午 → 辰 → 寅</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>庚</strong>(金)；干上 <strong>午</strong>(庚之官鬼)；末传 <strong>寅</strong> 旬空(寅卯空)。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　看克我的鬼、背后有没有帮凶</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：词讼看官鬼(对头)，也看末传有没有来助这个鬼——那往往是背后教唆的人。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：本盘干上午(火)克庚金＝<strong>官鬼</strong>当头，看末传寅是不是来助它。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　帮凶自己踩了空、使不上劲</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：末传本该像&quot;末助初鬼&quot;那样生助初传的鬼；可若末传自己落<strong>旬空</strong>，就成了扶不起的空架子。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：末传<strong>寅</strong>(木)本要生初传午火、助鬼克庚，可这寅自己坐了<strong>旬空</strong>——那个想教唆害我的人，帮凶落空、白费心机。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　断</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：末助初而末空＝枉做恶人。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：教唆的人反而自己败露、白当了一回恶人，害不成我。(与&quot;末助初鬼&quot;正相反：那盘末传坐实、因财致祸；这盘末传落空、教唆不成反败露。)</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：教唆者反自败露（吉）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 词讼看官鬼、也看末传有无助鬼(教唆者)　② 末传寅本助鬼、却自落旬空＝枉做恶人　③ 帮凶踩空、教唆害不成我　④ 教唆者反自败露；与&quot;末助初鬼&quot;(末实·因财致祸)正相反</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>飘《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》·枉做恶人格</p>\n<hr>", "q137": "<h3 id=\"例137-癸酉日-家内起讼-六亲\">【例137】⭐ 癸酉日 · 家内起讼 <code>六亲</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：三传内战格 · 癸酉日第八局昼占，发用未土为官鬼，三传层层相攻内战（讼自家庭而出）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>癸酉日</strong>白天来占：<strong>家里闹出事、要打官司</strong>，这场词讼凶吉如何？</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　官鬼　朱雀</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　兄弟　白虎</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">己　妻财　贵人</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>未 → 子 → 巳</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>癸</strong>；发用（初传）是 <strong>未</strong>，干上 <strong>午</strong>、支上 <strong>寅</strong>。昼占。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　占词讼先认&quot;对头/官司&quot; —— 取官鬼</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：占官司，第一件事是找盘里代表<strong>对头、官司、官方</strong>的字——这就是<strong>官鬼</strong>。口诀<q class=\"yw\"><strong>克我者官鬼</strong></q>（占病篇学过）：能管住我、压制我的，就是官鬼。词讼里，官鬼就是<strong>告我的人、这场官司、以及断案的官府</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：套到这盘：癸是<strong>水</strong>，克水的是<strong>土</strong>，所以对癸日<strong>土就是官鬼</strong>。看发用（初传）<strong>未</strong>土——<strong>官鬼一上来就当头发用</strong>，说明这事的核心就是官司、对头主动压上门。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　我理直还是理曲 —— 看官鬼生我还是克我</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：官司最关心<q class=\"yw\">谁有理</q>。窍门看官鬼和日干（我）的关系：<strong>官鬼生我、合我＝我理直、主胜</strong>；<strong>官鬼克我＝我理曲、主败</strong>（对头压过我）。这是求财篇<q class=\"yw\">生克</q>那套关系用到词讼上。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘官鬼未土，<strong>土克水（未土克癸水）＝官鬼正克着我</strong>——对头、官府都压在我头上，<strong>我理曲、主败</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　为什么是&quot;家内起讼&quot; —— 三传内战</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：再看整盘的气氛。若三传（连同脚下地盘）<strong>层层都是相克、一路互相攻打、没有一处相生来化解</strong>，叫<q class=\"yw\"><strong>三传内战</strong></q>——满盘打架、谁也不让谁。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘三传 <strong>未→子→巳</strong>，连它们脚下的字都是下面克上面、层层相侵，<strong>满盘相克、无一相生</strong>。争讼像窝里斗、两败俱伤，而且原文点明这讼是<strong>从自家门里闹出来的</strong>（家中藏着惹祸的人）。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：家藏罪犯（讼自家庭而出、两败俱伤）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 占词讼取官鬼＝对头/官司/官方（克我者）　② 官鬼克我＝理曲主败、生我＝理直主胜　③ 三传内战＝满盘相克、家内起讼两败俱伤　④ 官鬼当头，先看它生我还是克我</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》四库足本·三传内战格</p>\n<hr>", "q138": "<h3 id=\"例138-丁丑日-口舌文书-旬空-六亲-天将-德合禄马-类神\">【例138】⭐ 丁丑日 · 口舌文书 <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>天将</code> <code>德合禄马</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：朱雀内战格 · 丁丑日第三局夜占，朱雀乘亥临丑发用（亥水克朱雀火·口舌文书内乱）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丁丑日</strong>夜里来占词讼：为一桩<strong>文书口舌</strong>起了官司，能了吗？</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"ex\">乙　官鬼　朱雀</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">妻财　贵人　空亡</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　子孙　太阴</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>亥 → 酉 → 未</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>丁</strong>，夜占；发用（初传）是 <strong>亥</strong>、正乘 <strong>朱雀</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　词讼第二个用神 —— 朱雀</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：打官司离不开<strong>状纸、口供、消息</strong>。盘里管这些的，是十二天将里的<strong>朱雀</strong>。朱雀<strong>五行属火</strong>，专主<strong>口舌、是非、文书、状纸、信息</strong>。所以占词讼，朱雀是紧要用神，先看它落在哪、好不好。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘发用（初传）<strong>亥上正乘着朱雀</strong>——口舌文书之事一上来就当头，官司果然是为文书口舌而起。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　关键：朱雀&quot;内战&quot;了</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：天将各有五行，会按五行去生克脚下的字；反过来，<strong>脚下的字若克了天将，就是这天将自己先受了伤</strong>，叫<q class=\"yw\"><strong>内战</strong></q>（占婚篇<q class=\"yw\">六合内战</q>学过——吉神自身挨打、力量发挥不出）。判断前，务必先记住这天将属什么五行。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：朱雀<strong>属火</strong>，偏偏乘在 <strong>亥（水）</strong> 上——<strong>亥水克朱雀火</strong>，朱雀自身被浇灭。口舌文书之神受了内伤，主<strong>文书口舌之事内乱、纠缠不清、求谋不利</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　再看这亥是什么、空不空</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：找到发用，还要看它的<strong>六亲</strong>和<strong>空亡</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：亥水克丁火＝<strong>官鬼</strong>（对头/官司），官鬼又乘朱雀当头——<strong>官司连着口舌文书一起压来</strong>。中传酉是财、却正逢<strong>旬空</strong>（丁丑属甲戌旬、空申酉），争来的钱财也落空。<strong>（反过来记</strong>：朱雀若落空亡，反主<q class=\"yw\"><strong>口舌消散、文书不成</strong></q>，官司口舌可免——这盘朱雀不空，故口舌坐实。）</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：口舌文书（为文书口舌缠讼、求谋不利）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 词讼看朱雀＝口舌/文书/状纸/消息之神（火）　② 天将有五行，朱雀火被水克＝朱雀内战、口舌文书受伤内乱　③ 朱雀乘官鬼＝官司连着口舌　④ 朱雀若空反主口舌消散、文书不成</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》四库足本·朱雀内战格</p>\n<hr>", "q139": "<h3 id=\"例139-丁丑日-缠讼牵连-旬空-六亲-天将\">【例139】⭐ 丁丑日 · 缠讼牵连 <code>旬空</code> <code>六亲</code> <code>天将</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：勾陈内战格 · 丁丑日第六局昼占，勾陈乘卯临申发用（卯木克勾陈土·争讼牵连拖延）</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：<strong>丁丑日</strong>白天来占官司（与上一例同日、换个白天占）：这案子会不会<strong>牵连拖累、几时能结</strong>？</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">己　父母　勾陈</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　子孙　天后</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　兄弟　天空</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>三传</strong> <strong>卯 → 戌 → 巳</strong>，<strong>日干</strong> <strong>丁</strong>，昼占；发用（初传）是 <strong>卯</strong>、正乘 <strong>勾陈</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　词讼第三个用神 —— 勾陈</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：官司里，<q class=\"yw\"><strong>会不会牵连别人、拖多久</strong></q>由<strong>勾陈</strong>管。勾陈也是天将，<strong>五行属土</strong>，专主<strong>牵连、勾拖、缠绕、田土之争、牢狱</strong>。占讼看勾陈，就知道这案子缠不缠、结得快不快。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：这盘发用（初传）<strong>卯上乘着勾陈</strong>——缠讼牵连之象当头，一开口就是纠缠。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　勾陈也&quot;内战&quot;了</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：和上一例朱雀一样：先记住天将五行，再看它有没有被脚下的字克。<strong>勾陈属土</strong>，被脚下的字克，就是勾陈自身受伤（内战）。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：勾陈<strong>属土</strong>，偏偏乘在 <strong>卯（木）</strong> 上——<strong>卯木克勾陈土</strong>，牵连之神自身受克。主<strong>纠缠难解、案子拖着不结、越理越乱</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　这案子怎么走</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：再看发用的<strong>六亲</strong>和盘里的<strong>财</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：卯木生丁火＝<strong>父母</strong>（求财篇<q class=\"yw\">生我者父母</q>），父母又主<strong>文书、契约、田产</strong>——勾陈乘父母，主<strong>因文书田产而牵连</strong>。支上妻财申又逢<strong>旬空</strong>（甲戌旬空申酉），争的财也是空的。合起来：争讼牵连、缠绕拖延、求谋不利。<strong>（反过来记</strong>：勾陈若落空亡，反主<q class=\"yw\"><strong>官无讼、纠纷可解</strong></q>——这盘勾陈不空，故缠讼难了。）</li></ul>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：争讼牵连（缠绕拖延、案子难结）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 词讼看勾陈＝牵连/勾拖/田土/牢狱之神（土）　② 勾陈土被木克＝勾陈内战、牵连纠缠难解　③ 案子拖不拖、牵不牵连看勾陈　④ 勾陈若空反主讼解、纠纷可散</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《图解六壬大全·毕法赋》四库足本·勾陈内战格</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote class=\"star\"><p>⭐ <strong>以下出自《大六壬通解》下册<q class=\"yw\">历代六壬课例</q></strong>——出处可按页码逐句回查，盘为复算并与原书三传交叉验证过。</p></blockquote>", "q140": "<h3 id=\"例140-丁卯日-这场官司-一个官没审完-又换一个官-课体-年命-天将-刑冲破害\">【例140】丁卯日 · 这场官司<q class=\"yw\">一个官没审完，又换一个官</q> <code>课体</code> <code>年命</code> <code>天将</code> <code>刑冲破害</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：返吟（无依）· 丁卯日未将丑时 · 三传卯酉卯反复相冲，发用乘天空，行年戌上辰乘白虎</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：己巳年五月<strong>丁卯日</strong>丑时，一位乙酉生、四十五岁的人<strong>占官司</strong>（行年为戌）。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 卯酉为私门·反吟＝反复审 / 贵人坐私门＝换官 / 年上辰戌为牢狱乘白虎＝落狱 / 阴神与本命作合＝罪止遣戍</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　父母　天空</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"ex\">癸　妻财　贵人</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"ex\">丁　父母　天空</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：课体<strong>返吟</strong>，<strong>三传卯酉卯</strong>反复相冲；<strong>发用乘天空</strong>；<strong>贵人坐卯酉</strong>；<strong>太岁上神亥克丁</strong>（却正是今日<strong>德神</strong>）；<strong>行年戌上见辰</strong>、乘<strong>白虎</strong>；辰的阴神<strong>戌与本命作合</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　这场官司怎么起来的：见贵而起</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>贵人</strong>在讼事里是官长。看它坐在什么位置，就知道这案子从哪儿来、会怎么走。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">此讼<strong>乃见贵而起</strong></q>——因见官而起的讼。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　⭐ 为什么反复：卯酉是私门，又逢返吟</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>卯酉为私门</strong>（门户）；<strong>返吟</strong>主来回往复。贵人坐在私门上，就是<strong>审case的官换来换去</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">发用天空，三传反复是卯酉。<strong>卯酉乃私门也，贵人坐此，一官未了，又换一官，反复不止一次</strong>。</q></li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　会不会关进去：年上的牢狱之神与白虎</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：牢狱看<strong>行年上神</strong>：<strong>辰戌为牢狱</strong>；再看乘什么将——<strong>白虎</strong>则实。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">年上<strong>辰戌为牢狱，乘白虎，故主落狱</strong></q>；初末又都乘<strong>天空（狱）</strong> ⇒ 要坐牢。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　罪到什么程度：看有没有救、以及合</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：定罪轻重要找<strong>救神</strong>与<strong>合</strong>：太岁上神虽克日，但它若是<strong>日德</strong>，就是凶中有救；<strong>阴神与本命作合</strong>，主罪有转圜。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">喜<strong>太岁上神亥克丁，乃是今日德神</strong></q>⇒ 有救，不至于极刑；<q class=\"yw\"><strong>阴神戌与命作合，罪止遣戍而已</strong></q>⇒ 断<strong>发配充军</strong>，不是死罪。<q class=\"yw\">且贵临卯酉，占讼<strong>多牵他人</strong></q>⇒ 还会牵连旁人。后果<strong>一一如占</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">此讼乃见贵而起，罪重落狱遣戍也。盖发用天空，三传反复是卯酉。<strong>卯酉乃私门也，贵人坐此，一官未了，又换一官，反复不止一次</strong>。喜太岁上神亥克丁，<strong>乃是今日德神</strong>，年上辰戌为牢狱，乘白虎，<strong>故主落狱</strong>，<strong>阴神戌与命作合，罪止遣戍而已</strong>，且贵临卯酉，占讼多牵他人，后果一一如占。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：贵人坐卯酉私门＋返吟三传卯酉卯（因官而起·一官未了又换一官）＋行年戌上辰为牢狱乘白虎·初末乘天空（落狱）＋太岁上神亥克日却是日德（有救）＋辰阴神戌与本命合（罪止遣戍）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：官司因见官而起，会反复换审、牵连他人；要坐牢，但罪不至极，最后是发配充军</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 卯酉为私门；贵人坐私门＋返吟＝换官反复审　② 行年上辰戌为牢狱，乘白虎则实　③ 太岁上神克日却是日德＝凶中有救　④ 阴神与本命作合＝罪有转圜</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例二十七（王牧夫占讼，《牧夫占验》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p197｜PDF p929〕</span></p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote class=\"star\"><p>⭐ <strong>以下出自《大六壬通解》下册<q class=\"yw\">历代六壬课例</q></strong>——出处可按页码逐句回查，盘为复算并与原书三传交叉验证过。</p></blockquote>", "q141": "<h3 id=\"例141-丙寅日-兄告弟-坐两旬牢-会有贵人来解-课体-年命-天将-应期\">【例141】丙寅日 · 兄告弟：坐两旬牢，会有贵人来解 <code>课体</code> <code>年命</code> <code>天将</code> <code>应期</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：知一（度厄）· 丙寅日申将丑时 · 四课三上克下为幼度厄，魁罡乘蛇虎立卯酉，发用神后为旬首</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：天圣六年五月<strong>丙寅日</strong>丑时，一位丁卯生、六十二岁的富人<strong>占官司</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 三上克下＝幼度厄·尊凌卑 / 魁罡乘蛇虎立卯酉＝门户不宁 / ⭐ 旬首定期：发用与年上各是一旬之首 / 贵人临支＝有人释罪</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"ex\">甲　官鬼　六合</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"ex\">辛　子孙　太阴</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　父母　青龙</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：四课有<strong>三个上克下</strong>（<strong>度厄课</strong>）；<strong>魁罡（辰戌）乘螣蛇、白虎</strong>立于<strong>卯酉</strong>；发用<strong>子（神后）加丙</strong>，正是<strong>甲子旬首</strong>；行年上<strong>戌</strong>是<strong>甲戌旬首</strong>、又是<strong>丙的日墓</strong>；<strong>酉作贵人临日支</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　先定这场是非的性质：三上克下</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：四课<strong>上克下</strong>多，就是<q class=\"yw\">上面压下面</q>。<strong>三上克下</strong>主<strong>幼度厄</strong>——晚辈受尊长欺压而生讼。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">三上克下，为<strong>幼度厄</strong>，故主<strong>尊凌卑</strong></q>；再加<strong>魁罡乘蛇虎立卯酉</strong>（卯酉为门户）⇒ 断<strong>门户不宁</strong>。后果：正是<strong>兄长告弟弟</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　为什么会闹到打官司：旺者不受制</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：水火之间谁旺谁弱，决定<q class=\"yw\">压不压得住</q>。压不住就要反弹成争讼。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">神后（子水）加丙为用，<strong>水在五月为囚气</strong>，<strong>丙火正旺不受上神所制</strong>，则<strong>反起争讼</strong></q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　要不要坐牢：行年上见日墓</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：牢狱看<strong>行年上神</strong>是不是<strong>日墓</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">行年上见<strong>戌</strong>，<strong>戌为日墓</strong>，故<strong>主坐狱</strong></q>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　⭐ 坐多久：旬首定期</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：这是本例最特别的一手：<strong>发用与行年上神各是一旬之首</strong>，就以<strong>旬</strong>为单位定期。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">发用<strong>神后为甲子旬首</strong>，年上<strong>河魁为甲戌旬首</strong>，应以<strong>两旬为期</strong></q>⇒ 断<strong>须坐狱两旬</strong>（二十天）。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第⑤步　谁能捞出来、哪天进去</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：解救看<strong>贵人</strong>落在哪、与用神生克如何；进出的日子取<strong>墓神所应之日</strong>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">传中<strong>合、阴、龙俱是吉神</strong>，又是<strong>比用课</strong>，故主和允；<strong>酉作贵人临日支</strong>，顺行与用神<strong>金水相生</strong>，故得<strong>贵人释罪</strong></q>；<q class=\"yw\"><strong>卯上见戌，戌为火墓</strong>，故在<strong>丁卯日见官入狱</strong>也</q>。&lt;br&gt;后果：次日丁卯果然见官入狱；后由<strong>大尹（长官）劝和</strong>，小儿无责，课甚灵验。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">主门户不宁，卑幼为尊长所欺，反有词讼，<strong>须坐狱两旬，必有贵人释罪。来日丁卯便见官入狱也</strong>。果是兄讼其弟，得大尹劝和。</q>&lt;br&gt;论曰：<q class=\"yw\">魁罡乘蛇虎立卯酉，故知门户不宁，<strong>三上克下，为幼度厄，故主尊凌卑</strong>……发用<strong>神后为甲子旬首</strong>，年上<strong>河魁为甲戌旬首</strong>，<strong>应以两旬为期</strong>……酉作贵人临日支，顺行与用神金水相生，<strong>故得贵人释罪</strong>。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：三上克下为度厄（尊凌卑·门户不宁）＋子水囚而丙火旺不受制（反起争讼）＋行年上戌为日墓（坐狱）＋发用与年上各为一旬之首（两旬为期）＋酉贵临日支与用神金水相生（贵人释罪）＋卯上见戌火墓（丁卯日入狱）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：是长辈欺压晚辈引起的讼；次日丁卯见官入狱，坐两旬，有贵人出面解免（后果由大尹劝和了结）</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① 三上克下＝幼度厄·尊凌卑　② 魁罡乘蛇虎立卯酉＝门户不宁　③ 行年上见日墓＝坐狱　④ ⭐ 发用与年上各为旬首＝以旬定期　⑤ 贵人临支且与用神相生＝有人解免</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例一（苗公达占富人词讼，《一针见血》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p183｜PDF p915〕</span></p>\n<hr>", "q142": "<h3 id=\"例142-庚午日伏吟-占的人就是当事人-连村名都断出来了-课体-应期-取象-类神\">【例142】⭐ 庚午日伏吟 · 占的人就是当事人，连村名都断出来了 <code>课体</code> <code>应期</code> <code>取象</code> <code>类神</code></h3>\n<p><strong>格</strong>：伏吟（自任）· 庚午日午将午时 · 三传申寅申（原书作者主张），传送白虎俱为道路</p>\n<p><strong>占问</strong>：壬寅年六月<strong>庚午日</strong>午时。徐次宾因陇西公的案子躲在村里，他父亲替他求占<strong>这场官司</strong>。&lt;br&gt;⚠️ <strong>三传两说</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">六庚日伏吟者，<strong>古法以申寅巳为三传，一书以申寅申为三传</strong></q>。本条按<strong>原书作者徐次宾主张的申寅申</strong>排盘——他后面全部的应验都是按这一说走的；⭐ 而<strong>本站起课引擎与教材（《通解》口径）取古法申寅巳</strong>，两说并存，<strong>不替它选</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>带出</strong>：⭐ 六庚日伏吟的两说 / 传送白虎＝道路 / 中传为妻爻 / ⭐ 二七十四之数定日程 / 从字断姓氏·方位·里数·地名</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">勾</span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">空</span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">常</span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">玄</span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\">阴</span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\">后</span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\">贵</span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">蛇</span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">朱</span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\">合</span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">青</span><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"tj\">虎</span><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sanchuan\"><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">初传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　兄弟　白虎</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">中传</span><span class=\"z w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"ex\">丙　妻财　螣蛇</span></div><div class=\"cr\"><span class=\"lb\">末传</span><span class=\"z w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"ex\">壬　兄弟　白虎</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>盘要点</strong>：<strong>伏吟</strong>（月将＝占时）；<strong>三传申寅申</strong>，<strong>将虎蛇虎</strong>；庚<strong>寄申</strong>，<strong>申为传送、乘白虎</strong>；<strong>中传寅为妻爻</strong>、又是<strong>庚日之天马</strong>；<strong>发用申与白虎俱是七数</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么断</strong></p>\n<p><strong>第①步　⭐ 先说这一课的争议：六庚日伏吟怎么排</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">刑始于<strong>寅</strong>，终于<strong>申</strong>。甲戊丙日当<strong>尽三刑</strong>；<strong>庚日先刑而后冲</strong>也</q>——徐次宾据此主张庚日伏吟作<strong>申寅申</strong>（先刑后冲），而古法作<strong>申寅巳</strong>（走完三刑）。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：⚠️ 这类分歧在六壬里不少。<strong>处理办法是照录两说、各记依据</strong>；具体断的时候用哪一说，就看你从哪一说算得通——本例作者用申寅申，后面的应验一一对上。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第②步　人往哪动、几时动：传送白虎都是道路</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：<strong>申为传送</strong>、<strong>白虎</strong>也主道路。两者叠在一起，就是<q class=\"yw\">要走动</q>。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">盖<strong>传送白虎俱为道路</strong>，故<strong>壬申日动</strong>也</q>——壬申日徐次宾果然出门赴官。同日<strong>官府传唤他妻子</strong>：因<strong>中传寅为妻爻</strong>，正被<strong>申所克</strong>。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第③步　整件事走多久：二七十四</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：日程取<strong>类神之数</strong>：<strong>申七、白虎七</strong>，二七相乘得十四。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\">又发用申与白虎俱是七数，<strong>二七一十四数</strong></q>——陇西公<strong>己巳日入州</strong>、<strong>壬午日事毕</strong>，前后<strong>恰是十四日</strong>。&lt;br&gt;末传<strong>申为归计</strong>、又是庚的本位 ⇒ <q class=\"yw\"><strong>申日至家</strong></q>，后果<strong>戊申日</strong>归家。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>第④步　⭐ 姓什么、住哪、多远、村名叫什么</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>要点</strong>：细节靠<strong>每个字的多重象叠</strong>：<strong>传送（申）主张姓</strong>；<strong>午（先锋门）亦姓张</strong>；方位按支位取；里数取类神之数；地名从<strong>遁干的五行本色</strong>取。</li></ul>\n<ul><li><strong>本盘</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>传送主姓张人</strong>，先锋门午亦姓张人，<strong>案吏姓张，住正南胜光</strong>也；占亲人请客亦姓张，<strong>往西南传送</strong>也</q>；&lt;br&gt;<q class=\"yw\">所居村去州<strong>七里</strong>……盖<strong>中传寅为东北</strong>为七里，建得<strong>戊</strong>字，<strong>寅配艮为山</strong>，得<strong>戊寅即阜</strong>也。<strong>村名黄村，戊土黄也</strong></q>；&lt;br&gt;<q class=\"yw\">申数亦七，而<strong>止言七里者，伏吟主近故也</strong></q>——伏吟主不动、主近，所以取小数。</li></ul>\n<p><strong>原文</strong>：<q class=\"yw\"><strong>六庚日伏吟者，古法以申寅巳为三传，一书以申寅申为三传</strong>。余当谓刑始于寅，终于申……<strong>庚日先刑而后冲也</strong>……盖传送白虎俱为道路，故壬申日动也……又发用申与白虎俱是七数，<strong>二七一十四数</strong>……<strong>村名黄村，戊土黄也</strong>，申数亦七，而<strong>止言七里者，伏吟主近故也</strong>。</q></p>\n<p><strong>合起来看</strong>：六庚日伏吟（本例取申寅申）＋传送申乘白虎皆为道路（壬申日动身）＋中传寅为妻爻被申克（同日妻被传唤）＋申七虎七（十四日事毕）＋末传申为归计（戊申日到家）＋申午皆主张姓·寅为东北七里·遁戊土黄（黄村）——</p>\n<p><strong>断语</strong>：壬申日要动身赴官、妻同日被传唤；整件事十四天了结，戊申日回家；涉事的官吏姓张、住正南；所居离州七里、村名带黄</p>\n<p><strong>回顾</strong>：① ⭐ 六庚日伏吟两说：古法申寅巳／徐次宾申寅申——照录两说，别替它选　② 传送＋白虎＝道路　③ 中传可为妻爻　④ 二七十四：类神之数相乘定日程　⑤ 姓氏·方位·里数·地名都能从字上叠出来（伏吟主近，故取小数）</p>\n<p><span class=\"src\">〔出处〕</span>《大六壬通解》下册 · 第六章 历代六壬课例 · 例二十六（徐次宾亲历，《一字玉连环》）<span class=\"src\">〔通解下 p195｜PDF p927〕</span></p>\n<hr>"});